# Kept in the repo, never shipped to the CDN.

# js/app.bundle.js is a byte-for-byte concatenation of these files, and
# index.html loads only the bundle. Deploying both shipped ~1 MB of JavaScript
# twice. Edit these, run `npm run bundle`, deploy the bundle.
